    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Colony is a cosy, incremental,\u00a0idle-colony simulator designed to sit on top of your desktop allowing you to work on other tasks while growing your space colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asteroid Mining</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out probes to search for resources to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every asteroid increases your resources generated per minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.poster.avif?t=1755111017\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.webm?t=1755111017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/b4f164bc9e768f05a8595778544174ef.mp4?t=1755111017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Ships and Structures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build habs to house more colonists and watch the ships fly around your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.poster.avif?t=1755111017\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.webm?t=1755111017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825610/extras/055a0cd0da3ed1c015f500d3ccc98278.mp4?t=1755111017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research strange artifacts and develop new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new types of asteroids and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your fledgling settlement from tiny backwater to bustling metropolis.</p>",
